  "notebook_description": "The pinned tool-repository notebook processes a GNPS natural-products spectral library, computes greedy and modified cosine similarities, and inspects ranked matches. All source analyses are retained. Original code and narrative retain their respective mixed source notices; see Validation for full attribution and terms.",
